 ### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
 *   **Precision in Wait Time**: If $t_i$ approaches or exceeds $1/FPS_i$, $w_i$ becomes zero or negative, immediately triggering starvation [G].
+*   **Ray Accounting**: The scheduler must track remaining farm capacity accurately to avoid over-subscription when breaking from the user loop [G].
 
